start asking about\nordering and scope, then rep"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"orting\nan ambiguity score"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"ChatGPT (Codex)\n— called as an integration,\non a video-publishing harness: the interview,\nits adviso"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ry lanes, and the ambiguity ledger"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Claude Code\n— a YouTube automation task, with the six\nadvisory lanes running in parallel\nbefore the "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ouTube automation task, with the six\nadvisory lanes running in parallel\nbefore the interview submits"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Hermes (Discord)\n— a kart-racing game, run as a chat bot,\nending at Final ambiguity: 0.15"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness\n— an OSS-trend outreach script,\ndriven from a dsh chat:\nmcp__ouroboros__ouroboros_i"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"nterview\nturn by turn, fan-out results\nsubmitted between rounds"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Kiro\n— the Kiro CLI running the Ouroboros\ninterview flow, turning a vague request\ninto a structured,"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"o CLI running the Ouroboros\ninterview flow, turning a vague request\ninto a structured, testable Seed"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Antigravity\n— a YouTube-publishing automation interview:\nasks what to automate, shows advisory lanes"},{"id":"p20s2","text":",\nand submits the selected answer"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## The Ouroboros Agent OS Stack"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Like any OS, Ouroboros is split into a stable **OS layer** of primitives, an\n**application layer** o"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"f domain workflows, and a **shell** that humans actually\nsit in front of. Three repos, one stack:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Layer | Repo | Role | What it gives you |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Shell** (terminal clie"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"nt) | `Ouro-labs/ourocode` | Native terminal UI for running `ooo` workflows across Claude / Codex / "},{"id":"p24s3","text":"Gemini CLIs in one session | TUI, wonderTool decision pickers, MCP pane state, command discovery |\n|"},{"id":"p24s4","text":" **Apps** (domain workflows) | `Ouro-labs/ouroboros-plugins` | UserLevel plugin contract — composes "},{"id":"p24s5","text":"core primitives into installable domain programs (PR ops, Jira sync, incidents, releases) | Plugin m"},{"id":"p24s6","text":"anifest, scoped permissions, audit/provenance, reference plugins |\n| **OS** (this repo) | `Q00/ourob"},{"id":"p24s7","text":"oros` | Agent OS core — Seed, Ledger, Runtime, MCP, safety boundaries | `ooo` commands, spec-first w"},{"id":"p24s8","text":"orkflow engine, multi-runtime adapter |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"**How they connect:**"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- The **kernel** (`ouroboros`) owns the contract: every action becomes a\nSeed-bound, ledger-recorded"},{"id":"p27s2","text":", replayable event — regardless of which LLM\nexecutes it.\n- **Plugins** (`ouroboros-plugins`) declar"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"e scoped capabilities against that\ncontract, so domain workflows (review a PR, triage a Linear ticke"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"t, run a\nrelease) stay auditable and policy-bound instead of being one-off prompts.\n- **Ourocode** i"},{"id":"p27s5","text":"s the terminal shell: it surfaces MCP state, interview\nquestions, and wonderTool decisions as first-"},{"id":"p27s6","text":"class TUI elements, so you can\ndrive the OS without leaving the keyboard or switching between CLIs."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Use `ouroboros` alone with any supported CLI, layer plugins on for domain\nworkflows, or install `our"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"ocode` when you want a unified terminal cockpit."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"> **Disclaimer.** The Ouroboros project and community are **not affiliated with\n> any cryptocurrency"},{"id":"p29s2","text":", token, memecoin, or trading community** — including, but\n> not limited to, any \"ouroboros\" tickers"},{"id":"p29s3","text":" on pump.fun or other launchpads. This\n> is an open-source developer tool. We do not issue, endorse,"},{"id":"p29s4","text":" or hold any\n> coins. Any token claiming association with this project is unauthorized."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Why Ouroboros?"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Most AI coding fails at the **input**, not the output. The bottleneck is not AI capability -- it is "},{"id":"p32s2","text":" fails at the **input**, not the output. The bottleneck is not AI capability -- it is human clarity."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"| Problem       | What Happens                     | Ouroboros Fix                                 |"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"\n| :------------ | :------------------------------- | :-------------------------------------------- "},{"id":"p33s3","text":"|\n| Vague prompts | AI guesses, you rework           | Socratic interview exposes hidden assumptions"},{"id":"p33s4","text":" |\n| No spec       | Architecture drifts mid-build    | Immutable seed spec locks intent before code"},{"id":"p33s5","text":"  |\n| Manual QA     | \"Looks good\" is not verification | 3-stage automated evaluation gate          "},{"id":"p33s6","text":"| Manual QA     | \"Looks good\" is not verification | 3-stage automated evaluation gate             |"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Quick Start"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"**Install** — one command, everything auto-detected:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## What You Get"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"After one loop of the Ouroboros cycle, a vague idea becomes a verified codebase:"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"| Step          | Before                  | After                                                   "},{"id":"p41s2","text":"                |\n| :------------ | :---------------------- | :-------------------------------------"},{"id":"p41s3","text":"--------------------------------- |\n| **Interview** | *\"Build me a task CLI\"* | 12 hidden assumption"},{"id":"p41s4","text":"s exposed, ambiguity scored to 0.19                 |\n| **Seed**      | No spec                 | Im"},{"id":"p41s5","text":"mutable specification with acceptance criteria, ontology, constraints |\n| **Evaluate**  | Manual rev"},{"id":"p41s6","text":"iew           | 3-stage gate: Mechanical (free) -> Semantic -> Multi-Model Consensus    |"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"What just happened?"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"> Use `ooo <cmd>` inside your AI coding agent session, or `ouroboros init start`, `ouroboros run see"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"d.yaml`, etc. from the terminal."},{"id":"p45s1","text":"The serpent completed one loop. Each loop, it knows more than the last."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
